---
title: How diagonaldiagrams draws a figure
---
flowchart TD
    A([Agent writes a spec]) --> B[Check the spec]
    B --> C{Valid?}
    C -->|no| X[Errors with a fix]
    C -->|yes| D[Lay out and draw]
    D --> E[Audit the drawing]
    E --> F{Clean?}
    F -- no --> G[Repair the layout]
    G -.-> E
    F ==>|yes| H([SVG, HTML, receipt])
    X -.-> A
